{
  "about": "Every field a carrier may send to the one door (POST /mcp/api/inbound, src/inbound.mjs arrivalAtTheDoor) and the kind of value it holds. A field not named here is left out of the arrival and named back in ignored_fields, so a carrier learns at once that nothing reads it; a named field holding the wrong kind of value is refused. A new field a carrier sends is a row here.",
